        "bridgeIn": "Think about what happens in a room when someone with a microphone tries to corner a witness into a yes-or-no answer that isn't true. In November 2019, inside Courtroom 4B of the Essex County Courthouse in Newark, a veteran interpreter named Elena Morales faced that exact trap.",
        "bridgeOut": "When someone tries to shrink your truth into their binary, you don't need to raise your voice. You just need to name the missing condition.",
